{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0716_system_01",
      "hash": "9a38104f995eae02",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "It’s too high up...\\nYou can’t reach it!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0716_partner_a_01",
      "hash": "de5283e3612bc8f9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Pika?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0716_partner_b_01",
      "hash": "d9db43cc8dd9f806",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Vee?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0716_system_02",
      "hash": "9a380f4f995eac4f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Maybe [VAR PKNICK(0003)] could reach it, if there\\nwere some way to climb up there..."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0716_system_03",
      "hash": "9a380e4f995eaa9c",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "If there were a step stool or something, maybe it\\nwould be possible to reach the top from here!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0716_system_14",
      "hash": "9a34874f995b8f60",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Look around and see if you can find something\\nyou could climb up on!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0716_system_04",
      "hash": "9a380d4f995ea8e9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "This chair could probably be used as a step!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0716_system_05",
      "hash": "9a380c4f995ea736",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Up you go!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0716_partner_a_02",
      "hash": "de5280e3612bc3e0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Pika!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0716_partner_b_02",
      "hash": "d9db42cc8dd9f653",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Vee!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0716_system_06",
      "hash": "9a380b4f995ea583",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Now’s the time for your partner to shine!\\nGet the key that the Team Rocket Grunt threw!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0716_system_07",
      "hash": "9a380a4f995ea3d0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You look at [VAR PKNICK(0003)] with eyes full\\nof trust!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0716_system_08",
      "hash": "9a38194f995ebd4d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Go through the wall to reach the pipes on\\nthe other side!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0716_aporo_03",
      "hash": "70ecc882cf30c026",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "???: Where did that Cubone come from, Boss?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0716_karakara_01",
      "hash": "afa68ce57bd40ba5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "CUBONE: Maa..."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0716_sakaki_01",
      "hash": "8705e2c44b7a8fc1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "???: Two of my underlings decided to bring it\\nhere, without my permission."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0716_aporo_01",
      "hash": "70ecc682cf30bcc0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "???: The skull on its head is very beautiful...\\c\\nWe should be able to sell it for a good price\\nonce it becomes a Marowak."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main0716_aporo_02",
      "hash": "70ecc982cf30c1d9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "???: ... ... ..."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main0716_system_09",
      "hash": "9a38184f995ebb9a",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "It looks like they’re talking about something\\ncomplicated."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main0716_partner_a_03",
      "hash": "de5281e3612bc593",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "...Pika!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main0716_partner_b_03",
      "hash": "d9db41cc8dd9f4a0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "...Vee!"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main0716_system_10",
      "hash": "9a348b4f995b962c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0003)] got the [VAR COLOR(0006)]Lift Key[VAR COLOR(0000)]!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_main0716_musashi_01",
      "hash": "9282ba81ee37a857",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JESSIE: Did you hear something just now?"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_main0716_kojiro_01",
      "hash": "3c3113220278a5a5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JAMES: I did! There was definitely a noise!\\nCould it be...an intruder?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_main0716_partner_a_04",
      "hash": "de5286e3612bce12",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Pi..."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "msg_main0716_partner_b_04",
      "hash": "d9db48cc8dda0085",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Vee..."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "id": "msg_main0716_nyasu_01",
      "hash": "d5d98422263741ff",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "MEOWTH: Grrrrrr!"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "id": "msg_main0716_kojiro_02",
      "hash": "3c3110220278a08c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JAMES: ...Never mind.\\nIt must’ve just been Meowth’s hungry tummy."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "id": "msg_main0716_musashi_02",
      "hash": "9282bb81ee37aa0a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JESSIE: Don’t get me all worried over nothing!"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "id": "msg_main0716_musashi_03",
      "hash": "9282bc81ee37abbd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JESSIE: The boss’s Persian is so elegant..."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "id": "msg_main0716_kojiro_03",
      "hash": "3c3111220278a23f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JAMES: And that Fake Out move it uses!\\nIt always makes an opponent flinch in battle!\\r\\nIt’s strong AND cool..."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "id": "msg_main0716_musashi_04",
      "hash": "9282b581ee379fd8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JESSIE: Oh, did I tell you the news?\\nMy Ekans! It evolved!"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "id": "msg_main0716_kojiro_04",
      "hash": "3c310e2202789d26",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JAMES: Oh! Congratulations, Jessie! You know,\\nmy Koffing evolved into Weezing, too!"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "id": "msg_main0716_musashi_05",
      "hash": "9282b681ee37a18b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JESSIE: You know that Admin named Archer?\\c\\nHe uses this Golbat, and it flapped past me in\\nthe hall the other day...\\c\\nOooh, it gave me the creeps!"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "id": "msg_main0716_kojiro_05",
      "hash": "3c310f2202789ed9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JAMES: Archer has a Weezing, too, doesn’t he?\\c\\nI wouldn’t have thought that he and I would\\nhave the same tastes..."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "id": "msg_main0716_musashi_06",
      "hash": "9282b781ee37a33e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JESSIE: Guard duty sure is dull, isn’t it...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "id": "msg_main0716_kojiro_06",
      "hash": "3c310c22027899c0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "JAMES: Sure is dull, yeah..."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "id": "msg_main0716_bg_01",
      "hash": "633d1e3b1cd26624",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "It’s a solid box, holding a fire extinguisher...\\c\\nBut it’s too heavy for you to move!"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "id": "msg_main0716_bg_02",
      "hash": "633d213b1cd26b3d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "There’s something written on the papers...\\n“Team Rocket’s Greatest-Ever Secret Plan!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "id": "msg_main0716_bg_03",
      "hash": "633d203b1cd2698a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "This chair is awfully rickety...\\nIt doesn’t seem like you could move it."
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "id": "msg_main0716_bg_04",
      "hash": "633d1b3b1cd2610b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 40]"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "id": "msg_main0716_bg_05",
      "hash": "633d1a3b1cd25f58",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "It’s a map of the Kanto region—and it’s covered\\nwith notes about someone’s sinister plans!"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "id": "msg_main0716_bg_06",
      "hash": "633d1d3b1cd26471",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "This cardboard box is so heavy, you can’t lift it!"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "id": "msg_main0716_bg_07",
      "hash": "633d1c3b1cd262be",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "There’s a note on the wall, with a warning\\nscrawled on it!\\c\\n“Please don’t let any Pokémon in the air vents!\\nThey climb atop the walls and wreak havoc!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "id": "msg_main0716_bg_08",
      "hash": "633d173b1cd25a3f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 44]"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "id": "msg_main0716_bg_09",
      "hash": "633d163b1cd2588c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "There’s an intercom with a video screen...\\c\\nBetter not touch it if we don’t know who might\\nanswer at the other end!"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "id": "msg_main0716_bg_10",
      "hash": "633a193b1cd027ce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 46]"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "id": "msg_main0716_bg_11",
      "hash": "633a1a3b1cd02981",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "There’s a book lying on the table...\\c\\nDark Charisma: How You Too Can Become an\\nEvil Mastermind!"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "id": "msg_main0716_system_11",
      "hash": "9a348c4f995b97df",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0003)] came back to you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "id": "msg_main0716_system_12",
      "hash": "9a348d4f995b9992",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You got the [VAR COLOR(0006)]Lift Key[VAR COLOR(0000)] from [VAR PKNICK(0003)]!"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "id": "msg_main0716_system_13",
      "hash": "9a348e4f995b9b45",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)] is waiting for you!\\nJump with all your might!"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0716_max",
      "hash": "a27de33b6faa98c1"
    }
  ]
}
